### Crear rol (temporalmente sin auth hasta ISS-13)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@id = 3

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "SUPERVISOR", "description": "Supervisa operaciones" }

### Actualizar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "SUPERVISOR", "description": "Supervisor de ventas" }

### Eliminar lógico
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{id}}/deactivate

### Eliminar físico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{id}}